This product includes software developed at the dsh-plugin-agentjail project
(https://github.com/axetroy/dsh-plugin-agentjail).

It integrates with AgentJail (https://github.com/LuD1161/agentjail), which is
distributed under its own license. AgentJail is a separate program, not bundled
here; the plugin communicates with it over a local Unix domain socket. Review
AgentJail's license before deploying the two together.

Open Policy Agent (https://www.openpolicyagent.org/) and the Rego language are
projects of the Cloud Native Computing Foundation. Neither is bundled here. The
Rego policy templates under policy/ are original work of this project and are
licensed under the same terms as the rest of the source.

The Claude Code hook vocabulary that AgentJail and this plugin both speak
(`PreToolUse`, `tool_name`, `tool_input`) is used for interoperability. No
Anthropic source code is included.
